(7740685, 1276705, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely still life, these various blacks and attendant highlights.  Other than these, the vacancy of colors allows the forms and tonal nuances to come forward to be thoughtfully appreciated.  It''s a wonderful take, shyness set aside.  A true evocation of black.  My only quibble is that the composition feels a bit self-conscious in the manner of heaping up.  But still a remarkable showcase.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely still life, these various blacks and attendant highlights.  Other than these, the vacancy of colors allows the forms and tonal nuances to come forward to be thoughtfully appreciated.  It''s a wonderful take, shyness set aside.  A true evocation of black.  My only quibble is that the composition feels a bit self-conscious in the manner of heaping up.  But still a remarkable showcase.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2023-03-23 14:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
